# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Secrets / build-time config
# Real keys live here; dart_defines.example.json is the committed template.
# NOTE: --dart-define values are compiled into the binary. This keeps keys out
# of version control, NOT out of a shipped APK/IPA.
/dart_defines.json
*.keystore
*.jks
key.properties
env.json
